        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-251 (ensure controlled execution — DC Outbound Operations (PA-04.2).) | - operational: DC Operations Manager review and approval gate
Owner: DC Operations Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
