    <bpmn:process id="W_W1352" name="W1352. DC Outbound Pick Accuracy Verification, Short-Ship Prevention &amp; Error Reporting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Outbound pick completion for a replenishment order or ecommerce fulfillment wave
Frequency: Daily per DC; ~1,250 store-replenishment pick lines + ~140–145 ecommerce picks per DC/day (the ~3 lines/order production-measured order profile and the ~17,200/month home-delivery canon, per data-volumes §1.1)
Volume: ~5,500 picks/day across 4 DCs; ~165,000 picks/month (50,000 replenishment orders × ~3 lines — the production-measured order profile, per data-volumes §1.1 — plus ecommerce waves)
Owner: DC Outbound Supervisor
Participants: Picker, Quality Checker, DC Outbound Supervisor, Store Receiving Clerk (downstream)
Source: workflow W1352 — DC Outbound Pick Accuracy Verification, Short-Ship Prevention &amp; Error Reporting</bpmn:documentation>
