Responsible (R): Quality Checker
Accountable (A): DC Outbound Supervisor
Duration: 2 min/order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1352_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1352_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
