Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: 15 min/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1352_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1352_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
