    <bpmn:process id="W_W1353" name="W1353. DC Outbound Staging, Loading Bay Scheduling &amp; Dock Door Assignment Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Pick completion and verification for outbound orders (store replenishment or ecommerce)
Frequency: Daily per DC; 2 dispatch waves (morning for store replenishment, afternoon for ecommerce)
Volume: ~15–20 store-replenishment delivery loads + ~140–145 ecommerce parcels per DC/day (the consolidated-drop canon — 2–3 drops/store/week × ~50 stores/DC; the ~50,000 orders at ~20–30 orders per drop — per data-volumes §1.1)
Owner: DC Dispatch Coordinator
Participants: Staging Staff, Truck Drivers, 3PL Drivers, DC Outbound Supervisor
Source: workflow W1353 — DC Outbound Staging, Loading Bay Scheduling &amp; Dock Door Assignment Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1353_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1353_Lane1" name="System">
