    <bpmn:process id="W_W1369" name="W1369. DC Outbound Multi-Stop Route Optimization &amp; Philippine Road Constraint Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Wave released per W1368; outbound loads require route assignment and multi-stop sequencing
Frequency: Daily per DC during dispatch planning (6:00–8:00 AM)
Volume: ~155–165 shipments/DC/day (the ~15–20 consolidated store-delivery loads + ~140–145 ecommerce parcels, the W1353 staging basis); average 2–3 store drops per truck (the ~6–10 outbound trucks/DC/day W106 dispatch basis) = ~15–20 planned store stops/DC/day
Owner: DC Dispatch Coordinator
Participants: DC Dispatch Coordinator, 3PL Carrier Dispatcher, Store Manager (delivery window coordination)
Source: workflow W1369 — DC Outbound Multi-Stop Route Optimization &amp; Philippine Road Constraint Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1369_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1369_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1369_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1369_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1369_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1369_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1369_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1369_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1369_Lane2" name="DC Dispatch Coordinator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1369_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1369_Lane3" name="Carrier Driver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1369_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1369_Lane4" name="DC Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1369_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1369_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1369_Start6" name="Wave released per W1368; outbound loads require route assignment and multi-stop sequencing">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1369_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1369_Task7" name="System loads released wave orders with store delivery addresses, requested…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: System loads released wave orders with store delivery addresses, requested delivery windows, order weight/volume, and any special handling requirements (fragile, hazardous, temperature-sensitive)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1369_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1369_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1369_Task8" name="System applies Philippine road constraint database: (a) vehicle weight limits…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System applies Philippine road constraint database: (a) vehicle weight limits by road segment and bridge (e.g., provincial bridges rated for max 15 tons); (b) truck ban hours by city/municipality (Metro Manila: 6:00–9:00 AM and 5:00–9:00 PM for trucks ≥ 8 wheels); (c) number coding restrictions by city (Makati, Manila, Quezon City schedules); (d) RoRo ferry schedules and crossing times for inter-island routes (e.g., Cebu–Dumaguete, Batangas–Calapan, Davao–IGACOS); (e) seasonal road closures (typhoon-damaged roads, landslide-prone mountain passes during monsoon); (f) road height clearances for loaded trucks (low bridges, overpasses in urban areas)
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1369_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1369_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1369_Task9" name="System generates optimized multi-stop routes: (a) groups store deliveries by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System generates optimized multi-stop routes: (a) groups store deliveries by geographic proximity into truck routes; (b) sequences stops to minimize total distance and time while respecting delivery windows and road constraints; (c) assigns appropriate vehicle type per route (10-wheeler for high-volume routes, 6-wheeler for smaller drops or weight-restricted roads); (d) calculates estimated delivery time per stop based on historical traffic patterns by time-of-day and day-of-week; (e) for inter-island deliveries: aligns route with ferry schedule, includes ferry wait time buffer (1–3 hours), and plans backhaul route
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1369_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1369_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1369_Task10" name="DC Dispatch Coordinator reviews proposed routes: (a) verifies route feasibility…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: DC Dispatch Coordinator reviews proposed routes: (a) verifies route feasibility based on local knowledge (construction zones, recent road damage, market-day traffic in town centers); (b) adjusts stop sequence if a store has reported receiving dock unavailability (e.g., DSD delivery already occupying dock per W723); (c) confirms truck assignment matches carrier availability per W1163
Responsible (R): DC Dispatch Coordinator
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: 20 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1369_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1369_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1369_Task11" name="System transmits route plan to assigned 3PL carrier via carrier portal/app…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: System transmits route plan to assigned 3PL carrier via carrier portal/app: includes stop sequence, delivery addresses, estimated arrival times, special instructions, and navigation links; carrier driver acknowledges route
Responsible (R): System / Carrier
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1369_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1369_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1369_Task12" name="System sends advance delivery notification (SMS/app) to each store on the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: System sends advance delivery notification (SMS/app) to each store on the route: estimated delivery time window (± 2 hours), items coming, and number of pallets/cases; Store Manager confirms receiving staff availability
Responsible (R): System / Store Manager
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated + 2 min/store</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1369_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1369_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1369_Task13" name="During execution: if driver encounters unexpected road constraint (road…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: During execution: if driver encounters unexpected road constraint (road closure, bridge weight limit violation, ferry cancellation): (a) driver reports issue via carrier app; (b) system recalculates affected route segment with alternative path; (c) DC Dispatch Coordinator notified of schedule impact; (d) affected stores sent updated ETA
Responsible (R): Carrier Driver / System / DC Dispatch Coordinator
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: Per incident</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1369_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1369_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1369_Task14" name="Weekly: DC Manager reviews route optimization KPIs: (a) on-time delivery rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Weekly: DC Manager reviews route optimization KPIs: (a) on-time delivery rate by route; (b) cost per delivery stop; (c) truck utilization (% of capacity used); (d) average stops per route; (e) route deviation frequency and causes; (f) identifies consistently underperforming routes for re-optimization
Responsible (R): DC Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 1 hour/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1369_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1369_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1369_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1369_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1369_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-251 (ensure controlled execution — DC Outbound Operations (PA-04.2).) | - operational: DC Dispatch Coordinator review and approval gate
Owner: DC Dispatch Coordinator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W1369_Assoc17" sourceRef="W1369_Annotation16" targetRef="W1369_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
