    <bpmn:process id="W_W1370" name="W1370. DC Outbound Shipment Tracking, Store Delivery Confirmation &amp; POD Reconciliation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Outbound shipment dispatched from DC dock per W106; or store fails to confirm receipt within expected delivery SLA (1–3 days per model company profile)
Frequency: Continuous; ~1,800–2,400 store-delivery loads/month chain-wide (the consolidated-drop canon — 2–3 drops/store/week; ~60–80 loads/day — per data-volumes §1.1); ~450–600 per DC/month
Volume: ~15–20 store-delivery loads/DC/day — one POD confirmation per load = ~15–20 delivery confirmations/DC/day (the consolidated-drop canon, per data-volumes §1.1)
Owner: DC Dispatch Coordinator (outbound tracking); Store Receiving Clerk (delivery confirmation)
Participants: DC Dispatch Coordinator, Carrier Driver, Store Receiving Clerk, Store Manager, Supply Planner
Source: workflow W1370 — DC Outbound Shipment Tracking, Store Delivery Confirmation &amp; POD Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1370_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1370_Lane1" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Task15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1370_Lane2" name="Carrier Driver">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1370_Lane3" name="Store Receiving Clerk">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1370_Lane4" name="DC Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Task16</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1370_Lane5" name="Cost Accountant">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_Task17</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1370_End18</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1370_Start7" name="Outbound shipment dispatched from DC dock per W106; or store fails to confirm receipt…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1370_Task8" name="Upon dispatch from DC dock per W106: system creates shipment record with unique…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Upon dispatch from DC dock per W106: system creates shipment record with unique shipment ID, carrier name, vehicle plate, driver name, list of transfer orders included, total cases/pallets, dispatched timestamp, and expected delivery dates per stop
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): DC Dispatch Coordinator
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1370_Task9" name="System activates real-time shipment tracking: (a) carrier GPS/telematics feed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: System activates real-time shipment tracking: (a) carrier GPS/telematics feed provides vehicle location (owned fleet); (b) carrier app check-ins at each stop (3PL fleet); (c) system maps vehicle location against planned route from W1369
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1370_Task10" name="Carrier driver arrives at store; Store Receiving Clerk accesses shipment…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Carrier driver arrives at store; Store Receiving Clerk accesses shipment details on handheld: transfer order numbers, expected item list with quantities, case count
Responsible (R): Carrier Driver / Store Receiving Clerk
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1370_Task11" name="Store Receiving Clerk unloads and counts goods against shipment manifest on…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Store Receiving Clerk unloads and counts goods against shipment manifest on handheld; records quantities received per line item; flags discrepancies (shortage, damage, wrong item) per W109 and W666
Responsible (R): Store Receiving Clerk
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 20–30 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1370_Task12" name="Store Receiving Clerk confirms receipt in system: (a) lines matching —…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Store Receiving Clerk confirms receipt in system: (a) lines matching — auto-confirmed; (b) discrepancy lines — flagged with variance code (short, damaged, wrong) and quantity variance; (c) system transfers inventory ownership from DC to store for confirmed quantities; (d) system posts inventory receipt journal (Dr. Store Inventory / Cr. DC In-Transit Inventory)
Responsible (R): Store Receiving Clerk / System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 5 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1370_Task13" name="Carrier driver captures proof of delivery (POD) on carrier app: (a) Store…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Carrier driver captures proof of delivery (POD) on carrier app: (a) Store Receiving Clerk digital signature; (b) photo of loaded/unloaded goods at receiving dock (timestamped); (c) system records POD with GPS coordinates and timestamp
Responsible (R): Carrier Driver / System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: 2 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow27</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1370_Task14" name="System reconciles shipment: (a) matches dispatch quantities (DC) to receipt…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: System reconciles shipment: (a) matches dispatch quantities (DC) to receipt quantities (store) line by line; (b) if full match: shipment status → &quot;Delivered — Complete&quot;; (c) if discrepancies: shipment status → &quot;Delivered — Partial&quot;; discrepancy lines auto-routed to DC Dispatch Coordinator and Store Manager for investigation per W248; (d) in-transit inventory for discrepancy quantities remains in &quot;In-Transit&quot; status pending resolution
Responsible (R): System
Accountable (A): —
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow27</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1370_Task15" name="If store fails to confirm receipt within SLA (delivery lead time + 24-hour…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: If store fails to confirm receipt within SLA (delivery lead time + 24-hour buffer): (a) system generates &quot;Unconfirmed Delivery&quot; alert to DC Dispatch Coordinator and Store Manager; (b) DC Dispatch Coordinator contacts carrier driver for status; (c) Store Manager checks if goods were received but not yet processed in system; (d) if goods physically received: Store Manager instructs Receiving Clerk to post receipt immediately; (e) if goods not received: DC Dispatch Coordinator escalates to carrier per W1163 SLA enforcement
Responsible (R): System / DC Dispatch Coordinator / Store Manager
Accountable (A): DC Manager
Duration: 15 min/alert</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow29</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1370_Task16" name="Weekly: DC Manager reviews delivery confirmation metrics: (a) confirmation rate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 9: Weekly: DC Manager reviews delivery confirmation metrics: (a) confirmation rate within SLA — target ≥ 95%; (b) average time from dispatch to confirmation; (c) discrepancy rate by carrier and by DC; (d) unconfirmed shipment aging report; (e) POD completion rate — target 100%
Responsible (R): DC Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 30 min/week</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow29</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1370_Task17" name="Monthly: Finance reconciles in-transit inventory account: (a) system reports…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 10: Monthly: Finance reconciles in-transit inventory account: (a) system reports total in-transit inventory value; (b) aged in-transit items (&gt; 7 days unconfirmed) investigated; (c) write-off for confirmed losses per W92; (d) in-transit inventory must reconcile to sum of dispatched-but-not-yet-confirmed shipments
Responsible (R): Cost Accountant
Accountable (A): Controller
Duration: 2 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1370_Flow31</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1370_End18" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1370_Flow31</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1370_Annotation19">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-251 (ensure controlled execution — DC Outbound Operations (PA-04.2).) | - operational: DC Dispatch Coordinator (outbound tracking); Store Receiving Clerk (delivery confirmation) review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: DC Dispatch Coordinator (outbound tracking); Store Receiving Clerk (delivery confirmation)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
